<Canvas xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation" Width="32" Height="32">
  <!-- Molecule list window: the EmptyList window with its right half holding a pastel pink panel
       and a fluorene (two benzene rings joined by a five-membered ring, its CH2 apex toward the
       list on the left), drawn ball-and-stick in the Molecule icon's style (gray bonds, shaded red
       atoms). -->
